WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.156
"Oh no!" Tor cried.

2
00:00:06.157 --> 00:00:10.795
"I'm getting soaked!"

3
00:00:10.796 --> 00:00:14.288
Rain poured down on the buddies.

4
00:00:14.289 --> 00:00:18.037
"Where will we go?" Rex said.

5
00:00:18.038 --> 00:00:21.442
Rex looked around.

6
00:00:21.443 --> 00:00:27.174
"I see a cave!" he said.

7
00:00:27.175 --> 00:00:30.743
The buddies ran to the cave.

8
00:00:30.744 --> 00:00:35.013
"Whew!" Sara said.

9
00:00:35.014 --> 00:00:41.488
"It's dry in here."

10
00:00:41.489 --> 00:00:47.277
Suddenly a big dino yelled.

11
00:00:47.278 --> 00:00:52.391
"This is my cave!"

12
00:00:52.392 --> 00:00:58.363
"We're sorry!" Sara said.

13
00:00:58.364 --> 00:01:01.242
The buddies ran back outside.

14
00:01:01.243 --> 00:01:14.278
The buddies went in other caves.

15
00:01:14.279 --> 00:01:22.134
But none of them were empty.

16
00:01:22.135 --> 00:01:25.077
The buddies stood outside.

17
00:01:25.078 --> 00:01:30.084
"This is awful!" Tor cried.

18
00:01:30.085 --> 00:01:36.568
"Where can we go?"

19
00:01:36.569 --> 00:01:40.493
"I see a big rock!" Rex said.

20
00:01:40.494 --> 00:01:50.718
"Let's hide there."

21
00:01:50.719 --> 00:01:54.339
The buddies sat under the rock.

22
00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:57.074
"Yay!" Tor said.

23
00:01:57.075 --> 00:02:00.266
"The rain can't hit us here."

24
00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:03.245
Just then the wind changed.

25
00:02:03.246 --> 00:02:13.779
Rain splashed on the buddies!

